# Optional boot-kernel diagnostic, not part of the default A9 configuration.
# Merge after the pinned .config, then run olddefconfig. This also turns off
# hidden VT_CONSOLE_SLEEP, making pm_prepare_console/pm_restore_console stubs.
# Keep VT/TTY/PTY/serial consoles/DRM and the remaining PM configuration intact.
# Requires a kernel rebuild; not an overlay for the running kernel.
# CONFIG_VT_CONSOLE is not set
